1
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:07,048
RINRIN (20)
HOSTESS

2
00:00:07,132 --> 00:00:08,341
Why are you so condescending?

3
00:00:08,425 --> 00:00:09,884
Because you're not being consistent.

4
00:00:09,968 --> 00:00:10,969
MIMI (29)
HOSTESS

5
00:00:11,636 --> 00:00:14,139
It's not like I'm here
to be educated by you, Mimi.

6
00:00:14,222 --> 00:00:16,057
I'm saying you're free not to be.
I'm just saying--

7
00:00:16,141 --> 00:00:18,143
I still don't know
why you're being condescending.

8
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:19,936
I'm just saying, you won't be liked.

9
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,772
- I don't care if they like me or not.
- Then you should go home.

10
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:25,608
That doesn't matter.
It's not like I'm here to be liked.

11
00:00:25,692 --> 00:00:27,694
You should make an effort to be liked.

12
00:00:29,529 --> 00:00:31,197
SHARAN (21)
LOUNGE HOSTESS

13
00:00:32,032 --> 00:00:35,160
I think it's good to speak your mind.
It's good to have it out.

14
00:00:35,243 --> 00:00:37,912
I just felt that what you were saying
didn't match what you were doing.

15
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:41,166
- Huh?
- Excuse me. Sorry to interrupt.

16
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:42,959
Huh?

17
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:43,877
What?

18
00:00:44,919 --> 00:00:46,546
KAMAKEN (30)
MMA FIGHTER/BUSINESS OWNER

19
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:49,716
I screwed up today, so I just wanted
to apologize to everyone.

20
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:50,925
- I'm sorry.
- You're good.

21
00:00:51,009 --> 00:00:52,302
- It's fine.
- Sorry I did that.

22
00:00:52,385 --> 00:00:53,803
That's admirable.

23
00:00:53,887 --> 00:00:55,680
- He's great when he's calm.
- He really is.

24
00:00:55,764 --> 00:00:58,266
- That's what makes him scary.
- You're totally right.

25
00:00:58,349 --> 00:00:59,517
- Why are you apologizing?
- Yeah.

26
00:00:59,601 --> 00:01:01,770
Well, we had a pretty good vibe going on,

27
00:01:01,853 --> 00:01:03,021
but then I… well, you…

28
00:01:03,104 --> 00:01:04,439
you all had to step in.

29
00:01:04,939 --> 00:01:08,026
Well, of course, we're a team.

30
00:01:08,109 --> 00:01:09,235
- Thank you, guys.
- Mmm.

31
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:11,654
I'm glad you didn't get
expelled or suspended.

32
00:01:11,738 --> 00:01:16,159
Hey, Mimi, you really stuck by me
and tried to calm me down.

33
00:01:16,242 --> 00:01:17,077
So…

34
00:01:17,994 --> 00:01:20,330
could I talk to you outside
for a little bit?

35
00:01:21,081 --> 00:01:22,165
Oh, okay.

36
00:01:27,378 --> 00:01:31,299
Seriously, if you hadn't been there today,
I don't know what would've happened.

37
00:01:32,092 --> 00:01:34,177
So, yeah, I'm actually really grateful.

38
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,095
Thank you.

39
00:01:35,678 --> 00:01:37,889
You had a terrifying look on your face.

40
00:01:37,972 --> 00:01:40,517
You tried to stop me anyway.
Why did you do that?

41
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:44,479
Uh, because you shouted,
"I don't care if I get expelled!"

42
00:01:44,562 --> 00:01:47,190
And I was like, "No,
it's too soon for that. Way too soon."

43
00:01:47,273 --> 00:01:49,859
- Thank you.
- Like, it's only been one day.

44
00:01:49,943 --> 00:01:52,237
Yeah, I don't want to get expelled.

45
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,447
Now that I've cooled off, I don't want to.

46
00:01:54,531 --> 00:01:57,742
But I think you really took notice
of the fact that I was there,

47
00:01:57,826 --> 00:02:00,203
and you listened to me
and paid attention to me.

48
00:02:00,286 --> 00:02:04,124
I mean, it'd be pretty lame to go
fight again after what you did for me.

49
00:02:04,207 --> 00:02:06,835
I feel like
I really owe you a lot for today.

50
00:02:06,918 --> 00:02:08,211
No, I was glad to do it.

51
00:02:08,294 --> 00:02:11,131
If I hadn't stopped you,
would you have stopped yourself?

52
00:02:11,214 --> 00:02:13,466
Could you, if no one had stepped in?

53
00:02:13,550 --> 00:02:17,262
I probably would've just waited
for an opportunity to punch him.

54
00:02:17,345 --> 00:02:19,264
- You didn't stop.
- Hmm.

55
00:02:20,723 --> 00:02:24,644
Yeah, so you were the only one
who stopped me and tried to calm me down.

56
00:02:24,727 --> 00:02:28,106
- Well, I'm really grateful for that.
- I'm glad I stepped in when I did.

57
00:02:28,189 --> 00:02:29,774
But because of what happened,

58
00:02:29,858 --> 00:02:33,903
I feel like I want to get
to know you better and talk to you more.

59
00:02:34,946 --> 00:02:37,490
So, I guess,
for the one-on-one conversations,

60
00:02:37,574 --> 00:02:39,284
even though you're already taken,

61
00:02:39,367 --> 00:02:41,995
I wanna ask you
to come talk to me after you're done.

62
00:02:42,078 --> 00:02:43,830
Mmm.

63
00:02:44,414 --> 00:02:47,292
So, I think I'm gonna try harder.

64
