And I'd slap him a lot.

517
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:03,572
- Your little brother?
- Yeah.

518
00:22:03,655 --> 00:22:05,115
- I see.
- He never listened, so…

519
00:22:05,198 --> 00:22:06,116
Siblings fight.

520
00:22:06,199 --> 00:22:07,159
- Right.
- Uh-huh.

521
00:22:07,784 --> 00:22:09,828
