659
00:27:57,509 --> 00:27:58,510
Hmm, yeah.

660
00:27:59,302 --> 00:28:00,595
- <i>He's right.</i>
- Yeah.

661
00:28:00,679 --> 00:28:03,306
<i>So Tai-chan actually was hurt by that.</i>

662
00:28:06,184 --> 00:28:08,186
