I just feel so lost now.

666
00:28:19,030 --> 00:28:20,073
I'm like, whatever.

667
00:28:20,573 --> 00:28:21,533
Hmm.

668
00:28:25,328 --> 00:28:26,371
So…

669
00:28:29,791 --> 00:28:31,209
