672
00:28:42,470 --> 00:28:43,638
- Really?
- Yep.

673
00:28:43,722 --> 00:28:45,557
- It's hot, so eat it in one.
- Can I use this?

674
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,558
One bite.

675
00:28:46,641 --> 00:28:47,851
- One bite?
- Yeah.

676
00:28:47,934 --> 00:28:50,437
- That's crazy.
- In one bite. Not yet.

677
00:28:51,688 --> 00:28:53,523
- This is dangerous.
- Why?

678
00:28:53,606 --> 00:28:54,899
It's scalding hot.

679
00:28:54,983 --> 00:28:56,568
- Don't worry, it's not hot.
- Really? Sure?

680
00:28:56,651 --> 00:28:58,570
Real men are supposed
to eat <i>takoyaki </i>in one bite.

681
00:28:58,653 --> 00:29:01,030
- Okay, I got this, Mimi.
- Don't you dare spit it out.

682
00:29:01,114 --> 00:29:03,241
- I got this. Are you sure about this?
- Yep.

683
00:29:03,324 --> 00:29:04,743
- Go. Now.
- For real?

684
00:29:04,826 --> 00:29:07,036
- Don't cool it down, just do it.
- You guys are lying.

685
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:08,580
Be a man.

686
00:29:08,663 --> 00:29:10,081
Ow, hot!

687
00:29:10,165 --> 00:29:12,041
Hot, hot, hot! It's too hot!

688
00:29:12,125 --> 00:29:14,669
- This is not okay.
- It's pretty hot, huh?

689
00:29:19,966 --> 00:29:22,761
I really don't think
I can handle another week of this.

690
00:29:23,470 --> 00:29:24,721
Hmm.

691
00:29:31,728 --> 00:29:34,355
I'm being way too emotionally unstable,

692
00:29:34,439 --> 00:29:36,941
