- Seriously?

699
00:30:03,384 --> 00:30:07,722
Well, if you ask me
who I'm interested in or want to talk to…

700
00:30:08,973 --> 00:30:12,519
I guess it's Mimi,
because we haven't had many chances

701
00:30:13,269 --> 00:30:14,229
